{"id":"e9a96ab954b6013e","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md","title":"Cardinal Exponentiation","display":"df-cardinal-exponentiation — Cardinal Exponentiation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cardinal-exponentiation","aliases":["58-df-cardinal-exponentiation","Cardinal Exponentiation"],"display":"df-cardinal-exponentiation — Cardinal Exponentiation","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-function-set.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cardinal-exponentiation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cardinal-exponentiation</span><span>Cardinal Exponentiation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cardinal-exponentiation — Cardinal Exponentiation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa82947fba077a45\" href=\"?note=aa82947fba077a45\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-function-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-function-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"949691fe1747f59d\" href=\"?note=949691fe1747f59d\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md\">../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^\\lambda=\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(\\lambda\\times\\kappa):\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\}\">\\(\\kappa^\\lambda=\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(\\lambda\\times\\kappa):\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\}\\)</span> (function set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"aa82947fba077a45\" href=\"?note=aa82947fba077a45\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-function-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-function-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CardExp}_S:V^2\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{CardExp}_S:V^2\\to V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}exponentiation}\\vdash\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)=\\left\\lvert\\kappa^\\lambda\\right\\rvert\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}exponentiation}\\vdash\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)=\\left\\lvert\\kappa^\\lambda\\right\\rvert\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cardinal exponentiation: size of function space; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^\\lambda = |\\{f: \\lambda \\to \\kappa\\}|\">\\(\\kappa^\\lambda = |\\{f: \\lambda \\to \\kappa\\}|\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\kappa\">\\(2^\\kappa\\)</span>: power set cardinal; continuum function; very large for singular <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span></li>\n<li>GCH: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\kappa = \\kappa^+\">\\(2^\\kappa = \\kappa^+\\)</span> simplifies; fails at measurable cardinals, strong compacts</li>\n<li>Cofinality: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)\\)</span> controls when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^\\lambda &gt; \\kappa\">\\(\\kappa^\\lambda &gt; \\kappa\\)</span>; singular vs regular</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory: The Third Millennium Edition</li>\n<li>Kanamori, The Higher Infinite</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-function-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"aa82947fba077a45","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-function-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md","status":"resolved","id":"949691fe1747f59d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V$, $\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)$, $\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-function-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"aa82947fba077a45","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":